2026-06-04 09:44:38 - GeoTravelGlobalLogger - INFO     - [logger.py:345] - Google Reviews response content: {"status":"success","message":"Reviews retrieved successfully","data":{"reviews":[{"author":"John","profilePhoto":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLJMs_qJ3ixtKc8O-Nepjj_eFaaHOYWaLpBglkVy600jzQS_pIP=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"review":"I had a wonderful experience with Geo Travel and Tour. Their customer service was excellent from start to finish, friendly, professional, and always ready to answer my questions. The booking process was smooth and hassle-free, and they offered clear, detailed information about the itinerary and costs.\n\nThe trip itself was well-organized, with everything running according to schedule. Transportation was comfortable, accommodations were clean and convenient, and the activities were thoughtfully planned to ensure a rich and enjoyable experience. I particularly appreciated their attention to detail and willingness to accommodate special requests.\n\nOverall, Geo Travel and Tour exceeded my expectations. They made the entire travel experience stress-free and enjoyable. I would gladly recommend them to anyone looking for reliable, efficient, and friendly travel services.","published":"9 months ago","link":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108674861549503378620/reviews"},{"author":"Isaac Ewedemi","profilePhoto":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXEAJR4ZW_Tuk2FwiuMH9hYf0lUQzJdp9FI1DERzC5LmlrlK7IO=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"review":"I had a lovely experience at Maldives, Geo travels made the experience seamless as they handled all the bookings and tickets\n\nThe sea view from our hotel room was the first thing that captured our hearts.\n\nThe parasailing was our best moment, it was so much fun and I also loved that the staff had a drone shot of us in the air.\n\nI'll definitely recommend anyone to book an experience with them anytime any day.","published":"2 years ago","link":"https://www.goo